{"id":"631966","name":"西瓜皮水饺","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/631966/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西瓜皮","amount":"半个西瓜"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"肉馅","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"20g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"半个西瓜把瓤切出来。","img":"images/631966/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"瓜皮去掉红色部分，收拾干净。","img":"images/631966/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成小条。","img":"images/631966/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加盐拌匀腌制一会。","img":"images/631966/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"这时候去和面。盐粉加盐加水。","img":"images/631966/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"和成面团盖保鲜膜静置。","img":"images/631966/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"瓜皮已经变软。过水洗净，沥水。","img":"images/631966/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放料理机。","img":"images/631966/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"打碎。","img":"images/631966/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"挤干水分。","img":"images/631966/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"肉馅加盐、鸡精、胡椒粉、姜粉、糖、蚝油、料酒、生抽、老抽拌匀。","img":"images/631966/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加姜末。","img":"images/631966/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加葱花。","img":"images/631966/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加西瓜皮、香油。","img":"images/631966/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"拌匀备用。","img":"images/631966/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"取面团。","img":"images/631966/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"分剂。","img":"images/631966/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/631966/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"加馅料。","img":"images/631966/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"包饺子。","img":"images/631966/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"水开下饺子，三开。","img":"images/631966/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/631966/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"一起吃水饺吧！","img":"images/631966/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}